{"id":"labor-eval-case-08-04","taskType":"case_retrieval","split":"test","groupId":"case-spc-2025-mixed-employers","query":"最初是甲公司招进来的，可场地标识、聊天群和干的业务都属于乙公司，两家公司老板又相同。有没有员工要求确认与乙公司存在劳动关系的实例？","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["case-spc-2025-mixed-employers"],"expectedCitationRefs":["case-src-spc-20250801-labor:p0025"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"裁判段说明员工有理由相信为实际场地及业务所属公司工作，并支持其确认请求；甲乙为题面匿名改述。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-case-09-01","taskType":"case_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"case-third-01-platform-truck","query":"我自己买车给平台拉货，每天必须签到并跑满四单，拒单还会扣钱，但协议只写合作。想找这种司机关系认定的案例。","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["case-third-01-platform-truck"],"expectedCitationRefs":["case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0017","case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0025"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"自备面包车、最低日单量、签到和奖惩是该案核心用工事实，处理段认定存在劳动管理。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-case-09-02","taskType":"case_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"case-third-01-platform-truck","query":"货运平台给固定包月服务费，还报销油费路费，要求本人每天跑八小时以上。合同叫车辆管理协议，这种司机有没有被认成劳动者的例子？","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["case-third-01-platform-truck"],"expectedCitationRefs":["case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0017","case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0025"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"事实段包含包月费、费用报销、本人驾驶及实际时长，处理段支持劳动关系及解除补偿。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-case-09-03","taskType":"case_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"case-third-01-platform-truck","query":"平台一直跟踪我的运输订单，派单、价格和扣款都由它定，却说用我自己的车就不算员工。想看实际管理比合同名称更重要的相关案件。","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["case-third-01-platform-truck"],"expectedCitationRefs":["case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0017","case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0024","case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0025"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"原文支持自备车和平台管理，事实优先及从属性分析在后两段；题面的抗辩是情境构造而非引用原案答辩。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-case-09-04","taskType":"case_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"case-third-01-platform-truck","query":"货运平台因运营调整提前结束车辆合作，司机平时按固定单量和时间干活。有没有最终拿到解除劳动合同经济补偿的案例？","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["case-third-01-platform-truck"],"expectedCitationRefs":["case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0017","case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0021","case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0025"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"事实记载运营调整终止协议，结果段明确经济补偿，理由解释合作终止为何构成劳动关系解除。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-case-10-01","taskType":"case_retrieval","split":"test","groupId":"case-third-02-crowdsourced-courier","query":"我送外卖完全自己决定哪天上线、接多少单，只是迟到或差评会扣服务费。这类众包骑手有没有没被认定劳动关系的案例？","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["case-third-02-crowdsourced-courier"],"expectedCitationRefs":["case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0030","case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0038"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"该案无上线时间和单量要求，扣费规则仍存在，但管理程度不足以确认劳动关系，属于有资料的负面结论。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-case-10-02","taskType":"case_retrieval","split":"test","groupId":"case-third-02-crowdsourced-courier","query":"众包骑手靠抢单赚钱，平台没要求固定排班，想让平台签劳动合同、交社保，有类似请求没获支持的实例吗？","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["case-third-02-crowdsourced-courier"],"expectedCitationRefs":["case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0030","case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0034","case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0038"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"事实段记载自主抢单及签合同缴社保请求，结果和理由为不支持，不应被标成资料缺失。"}
