{"id":"labor-eval-case-11-01","taskType":"case_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"case-third-03-station-outsourcing","query":"我跟劳务公司签配送协议，实际却天天听配送站安排早会、排班、请假和扣款。想找应该和哪家公司认劳动关系的案例。","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["case-third-03-station-outsourcing"],"expectedCitationRefs":["case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0043","case-src-nanyang-20230609-third:p0050"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"签约公司与实际管理站点公司分离，早会和请假等事实及关系归属理由均可定位。"}
