{"id":"labor-eval-provision-02-01","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"test","groupId":"labor-arbitration-law-2007","query":"公司欠我的工资拖了很久，但我还在职，劳动仲裁的一年期限是不是也照常算？请找对应条文。","topic":"wage_arrears","expectedRecordIds":["labor-arbitration-law-2007:a004"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-arbitration-2007:p0068","law-arbitration-2007:p0071"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"第二十七条列一般时效，并专门区分关系存续期间欠薪与关系终止后的期限；只检索该规则。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-02-02","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"test","groupId":"labor-arbitration-law-2007","query":"我已经向公司追过欠薪，公司也答应会还，这会不会让仲裁时效重新起算？要查规定本身。","topic":"wage_arrears","expectedRecordIds":["labor-arbitration-law-2007:a004"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-arbitration-2007:p0069"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"该款明确主张权利、请求救济和同意履行导致时效中断并重新计算，不判断题面行为是否已被证明。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-02-03","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"test","groupId":"labor-arbitration-law-2007","query":"劳动争议要用的证据都在公司手里，我拿不到，仲裁能不能要求它交，拒交有什么后果？","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["labor-arbitration-law-2007:a002","labor-arbitration-law-2007:a005"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-arbitration-2007:p0024","law-arbitration-2007:p0098"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"第六条和第三十九条分别说明单位掌握证据时的提供义务、不利后果及仲裁庭要求提供，均为直接相关条文。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-03-01","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"labor-contract-law-2012","query":"先入职干活、后补签劳动合同，劳动关系从什么时候开始，书面合同最迟什么时候签？","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["labor-contract-law-2012:a001","labor-contract-law-2012:a002"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-contract-2012:p0033","law-contract-2012:p0036","law-contract-2012:p0037"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"第七条回答用工起点，第十条回答书面合同及一个月期限，完整查询需要两条。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-03-02","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"labor-contract-law-2012","query":"刚招进来没签合同，工资也没说清楚，集体合同又没定标准，有没有规定不能随便压价、要同工同酬？","topic":"wage_arrears","expectedRecordIds":["labor-contract-law-2012:a003","labor-contract-law-2012:a004"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-contract-2012:p0039","law-contract-2012:p0064"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"第十一条直接覆盖新招用且报酬不明，第十八条也规定无相应集体约定时的劳动报酬处理；不据此计算数额。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-03-03","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"labor-contract-law-2012","query":"超过一个月还没签书面劳动合同，二倍工资在什么时间范围内有规定？我想查原条文。","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["labor-contract-law-2012:a007"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-contract-2012:p0231"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"第八十二条第一款限定超过一个月不满一年且未订立书面合同的区间，题面不含不满一月折算问题。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-04-01","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"test","groupId":"labor-dispute-interpretation-i-2020","query":"单位给了工资欠条，除了这笔欠款没有其他劳动关系争议，能不能直接按普通民事纠纷去法院？找条文。","topic":"wage_arrears","expectedRecordIds":["labor-dispute-interpretation-i-2020:a002"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-judicial-i-2020:p0058"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"该条特别限定工资欠条且不涉及劳动关系其他争议，是直接相关依据；不把一般工资争议都归入民事。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-04-02","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"test","groupId":"labor-dispute-interpretation-i-2020","query":"我要主张加班费，证明加班这件事是谁负责？如果考勤证据在单位手里而它不拿出来呢？","topic":"wage_arrears","expectedRecordIds":["labor-dispute-interpretation-i-2020:a003","labor-arbitration-law-2007:a002","labor-arbitration-law-2007:a005"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-judicial-i-2020:p0110","law-arbitration-2007:p0024","law-arbitration-2007:p0098"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"第四十二条直接区分加班事实责任及单位掌握证据例外，两条仲裁法记录补充相同证据控制情形的一般规则。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-04-03","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"test","groupId":"labor-dispute-interpretation-i-2020","query":"双方谈好调整劳动合同后已经实际干了一个多月，只是没写下来，还能单凭没书面文件说调整无效吗？查相关司法解释。","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["labor-dispute-interpretation-i-2020:a004"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-judicial-i-2020:p0111"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"第四十三条包含协商一致、实际履行超过一个月、内容合法等条件；题目检索条件规则，不替个案认定有效。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-05-01","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"labor-dispute-interpretation-ii-2025","query":"没签合同，被几家关联公司轮流或同时用工，法院认劳动关系会综合看哪些实际情况？","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["labor-dispute-interpretation-ii-2025:a003"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-judicial-ii-2025:p0022","law-judicial-ii-2025:p0024"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"第三条第二项明确无书面合同的关联单位交替同时用工，列举工作时间内容、付薪、社保等因素。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-05-02","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"labor-dispute-interpretation-ii-2025","query":"没签书面劳动合同产生的二倍工资，有一个月只干了部分工作日，该怎么按条文确定计算口径？","topic":"wage_arrears","expectedRecordIds":["labor-dispute-interpretation-ii-2025:a004"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-judicial-ii-2025:p0031"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"第六条专门规定按月及不满一月按实际工作日计算，原文可直接支持查询的计算口径。"}
{"id":"labor-eval-provision-05-03","taskType":"provision_retrieval","split":"dev","groupId":"labor-dispute-interpretation-ii-2025","query":"仲裁时自己没提时效抗辩，到了法院才提，还有拿到新证据的例外吗？想找这段规定。","topic":"employment_relationship","expectedRecordIds":["labor-dispute-interpretation-ii-2025:a007"],"expectedCitationRefs":["law-judicial-ii-2025:p0068","law-judicial-ii-2025:p0069"],"annotationStatus":"agent_curated_not_legal_expert_reviewed","rationale":"第二十条直接处理未在仲裁提抗辩、后续诉讼与新证据例外及再审边界，不与一般时效长度混同。"}
